{"id":16418,"date":"2025-04-04T13:42:53","date_gmt":"2025-04-04T13:42:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/?p=16418"},"modified":"2025-04-04T16:07:37","modified_gmt":"2025-04-04T16:07:37","slug":"devlop-participa-no-evento-el-futuro-de-la-logistica","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/devlop.systems\/devlop-participa-no-evento-el-futuro-de-la-logistica\/","title":{"rendered":"Devlop Participa no Evento El Futuro de la Log\u00edstica"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"16418\" class=\"elementor elementor-16418\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3bc9a670 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"3bc9a670\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-514b204a\" data-id=\"514b204a\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6025bc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f6025bc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}<\/style><h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Devlop apresenta-se como oradora no evento internacional \u201cEl Futuro de la Log\u00edstica\u201d<\/h4>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17159d4c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"17159d4c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t<p class=\"\" data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"467\">No passado dia <strong data-start=\"273\" data-end=\"287\">3 de abril<\/strong>, a <strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"301\">Devlop<\/strong> teve a honra de participar como <strong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"345\">oradora<\/strong> no evento internacional <strong data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"438\">\u201cEl Futuro de la Log\u00edstica: IA, Automatizaci\u00f3n y Sostenibilidad\u201d<\/strong>, realizado em <strong data-start=\"453\" data-end=\"464\">Sevilha<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"710\">Este encontro reuniu especialistas e empresas de refer\u00eancia do setor log\u00edstico, com o objetivo de debater o impacto da <strong data-start=\"588\" data-end=\"620\">Intelig\u00eancia Artificial (IA)<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"635\">automa\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong> e <strong data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"658\">sustentabilidade<\/strong> na transforma\u00e7\u00e3o da cadeia de abastecimento global.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34db377 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"34db377\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.18.0 - 08-12-2023 *\/\n.elementor-column .elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--spacer-size)}.e-con{--container-widget-width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer{width:var(--container-widget-width,var(--spacer-size));--align-self:var(--container-widget-align-self,initial);--flex-shrink:0}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container{height:100%;width:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer{height:100%}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer>.elementor-widget-container>.elementor-spacer>.elementor-spacer-inner{height:var(--container-widget-height,var(--spacer-size))}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty{position:relative;min-height:22px;min-width:22px}.e-con-inner>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty .elementor-widget-empty-icon,.e-con>.elementor-widget-spacer.elementor-widget-empty .elementor-widget-empty-icon{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;margin:auto;padding:0;width:22px;height:22px}<\/style>\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b5f7b3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9b5f7b3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 data-start=\"717\" data-end=\"787\">A interven\u00e7\u00e3o da Devlop: \u201cAI: A Game Changer for the Supply Chain\u201d<\/h6><p class=\"\" data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"1025\">O nosso <strong data-start=\"797\" data-end=\"841\">Managing Partner, Hugo Duarte da Fonseca<\/strong>, conduziu a apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o intitulada <strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"923\">\u201cAI: A Game Changer for the Supply Chain\u201d<\/strong>, onde explorou o papel revolucion\u00e1rio da Intelig\u00eancia Artificial na ind\u00fastria do transporte mar\u00edtimo.<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1342\">A sess\u00e3o iniciou-se com uma breve introdu\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 IA e \u00e0 sua crescente import\u00e2ncia em m\u00faltiplos sectores, com especial enfoque na cadeia de abastecimento e na log\u00edstica mar\u00edtima. Foram abordadas as formas como a IA est\u00e1 a redesenhar processos, aumentar a efici\u00eancia e reduzir os erros humanos, nomeadamente atrav\u00e9s de:<\/p><ul data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1637\"><li class=\"\" data-start=\"1344\" data-end=\"1446\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1446\"><strong data-start=\"1346\" data-end=\"1385\">Automatiza\u00e7\u00e3o de tarefas rotineiras<\/strong>, libertando recursos humanos para atividades estrat\u00e9gicas;<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"1447\" data-end=\"1549\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1549\"><strong data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1470\">An\u00e1lise preditiva<\/strong>, permitindo uma gest\u00e3o mais eficaz da procura, dos stocks e da distribui\u00e7\u00e3o;<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"1637\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1637\"><strong data-start=\"1552\" data-end=\"1592\">Processamento de dados em tempo real<\/strong>, melhorando a tomada de decis\u00e3o operacional.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d304646 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"d304646\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-526aa67 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"526aa67\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 data-start=\"3074\" data-end=\"3113\">Construir o seu pr\u00f3prio LLM privado<\/h6><p class=\"\" data-start=\"3115\" data-end=\"3322\">Uma das solu\u00e7\u00f5es abordadas foi a possibilidade de as empresas constru\u00edrem o seu <strong data-start=\"3195\" data-end=\"3233\">LLM (Large Language Model) privado<\/strong>, capaz de analisar diariamente emails, ficheiros, sistemas ERP e outras fontes internas.<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"3533\" data-end=\"3686\">Este tipo de tecnologia permite uma <strong data-start=\"3569\" data-end=\"3620\">gest\u00e3o baseada em dados privados, em tempo real<\/strong>, com vantagens claras em termos de agilidade e tomada de decis\u00e3o.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec35eab elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"ec35eab\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-532f269 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"532f269\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 data-start=\"1644\" data-end=\"1694\">Casos de Estudo: IA aplicada a opera\u00e7\u00f5es reais<\/h6><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1839\">A apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o incluiu a partilha de <strong data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1762\">casos de estudo concretos<\/strong> de empresas que j\u00e1 implementam solu\u00e7\u00f5es de IA nos seus processos log\u00edsticos:<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1696\" data-end=\"1839\"><strong>1. Cargofive<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1862\" data-end=\"1940\">Automatiza respostas a pedidos de cota\u00e7\u00e3o de transit\u00e1rios.<br data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1923\" \/><strong data-start=\"1923\" data-end=\"1938\">Resultados:<\/strong><\/p><ul data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2049\"><li class=\"\" data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1978\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1978\">Tempo de resposta reduzido em 75%<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"1979\" data-end=\"2008\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2008\">Precis\u00e3o aumentada em 90%<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"2009\" data-end=\"2049\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"2011\" data-end=\"2049\">Satisfa\u00e7\u00e3o do cliente melhorada em 25%<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2068\"><strong data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2066\">2. Meight<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"2069\" data-end=\"2164\">Utiliza IA para previs\u00e3o de tempos de condu\u00e7\u00e3o e otimiza\u00e7\u00e3o de planeamento.<br data-start=\"2144\" data-end=\"2147\" \/><strong data-start=\"2147\" data-end=\"2162\">Resultados:<\/strong><\/p><ul data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2274\"><li class=\"\" data-start=\"2165\" data-end=\"2203\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2203\">Controlo de custos com combust\u00edvel<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2240\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"2206\" data-end=\"2240\">Dete\u00e7\u00e3o de incumprimentos legais<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"2241\" data-end=\"2274\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"2243\" data-end=\"2274\">Otimiza\u00e7\u00e3o de rotas e opera\u00e7\u00f5es<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2294\"><strong data-start=\"2281\" data-end=\"2292\">3. Nabu.io<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2374\">Automatiza a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o aduaneira de mercadorias com IA.<br data-start=\"2354\" data-end=\"2357\" \/><strong data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2372\">Resultados:<\/strong><\/p><ul data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2487\"><li class=\"\" data-start=\"2375\" data-end=\"2410\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"2377\" data-end=\"2410\">Maior precis\u00e3o na classifica\u00e7\u00e3o<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"2411\" data-end=\"2443\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2443\">Redu\u00e7\u00e3o de erros documentais<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2487\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2487\">Extra\u00e7\u00e3o automatizada de dados relevantes<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-00dcf15 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"00dcf15\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d2a43c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3d2a43c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 data-start=\"3693\" data-end=\"3737\">Benef\u00edcios e desafios da IA na log\u00edstica<\/h6><p class=\"\" data-start=\"3739\" data-end=\"3777\">A IA oferece vantagens significativas:<\/p><ul data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3971\"><li class=\"\" data-start=\"3778\" data-end=\"3828\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"3780\" data-end=\"3828\"><strong data-start=\"3780\" data-end=\"3806\">Efici\u00eancia operacional<\/strong> e redu\u00e7\u00e3o de custos<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"3829\" data-end=\"3882\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"3831\" data-end=\"3882\"><strong data-start=\"3831\" data-end=\"3849\">Maior precis\u00e3o<\/strong> no rastreio e gest\u00e3o de envios<\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"3883\" data-end=\"3971\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3971\"><strong data-start=\"3885\" data-end=\"3910\">Satisfa\u00e7\u00e3o do cliente<\/strong> atrav\u00e9s de entregas mais r\u00e1pidas e comunica\u00e7\u00e3o em tempo real<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"\" data-start=\"3973\" data-end=\"4011\">Mas tamb\u00e9m traz desafios a considerar:<\/p><ul data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4169\"><li class=\"\" data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4056\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4056\"><strong data-start=\"4014\" data-end=\"4054\">Custos de implementa\u00e7\u00e3o e manuten\u00e7\u00e3o<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"4057\" data-end=\"4097\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4097\"><strong data-start=\"4059\" data-end=\"4095\">Privacidade e seguran\u00e7a de dados<\/strong><\/p><\/li><li class=\"\" data-start=\"4098\" data-end=\"4169\"><p class=\"\" data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4169\"><strong data-start=\"4100\" data-end=\"4132\">Impacto na for\u00e7a de trabalho<\/strong>, exigindo requalifica\u00e7\u00e3o e adapta\u00e7\u00e3o<\/p><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-521b6d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"521b6d5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b5df32d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b5df32d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h6 data-start=\"4176\" data-end=\"4214\">O futuro da Supply Chain \u00e9 digital<\/h6><p class=\"\" data-start=\"4216\" data-end=\"4383\">\u00c0 medida que a tecnologia evolui, a <strong data-start=\"4252\" data-end=\"4382\">IA continuar\u00e1 a desempenhar um papel fundamental na cria\u00e7\u00e3o de cadeias de abastecimento mais sustent\u00e1veis, \u00e1geis e resilientes<\/strong>.<\/p><p class=\"\" data-start=\"4385\" data-end=\"4574\">Na Devlop, continuamos empenhados em liderar esta transforma\u00e7\u00e3o e em apoiar as organiza\u00e7\u00f5es a adaptarem-se a um futuro onde a <strong data-start=\"4511\" data-end=\"4531\">inova\u00e7\u00e3o digital<\/strong> ser\u00e1 cada vez mais um fator diferenciador.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb6a80b elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"bb6a80b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d36ad3f e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d36ad3f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;container_type&quot;:&quot;flex&quot;,&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5994278 elementor-widget elementor-widget-gallery\" data-id=\"5994278\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;gallery_layout&quot;:&quot;justified&quot;,&quot;lazyload&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;ideal_row_height&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:200,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;ideal_row_height_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:150,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;ideal_row_height_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:150,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;gap&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;gap_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;gap_mobi